# Host canonicalisation for Cloudflare Pages / Netlify.
#
# santharpanaspa.com and www.santharpanaspa.com both used to answer with 200 and
# no redirect between them, so search engines saw two copies of every page and
# split the ranking signals across both. The canonical tags name the www host, so
# the apex redirects to it.
#
# Path redirects are deliberately NOT handled here: /appoinment and /description
# are prerendered as real files that bounce client-side, because a static host
# serves an existing file in preference to a rule in this table.

https://santharpanaspa.com/*  https://www.santharpanaspa.com/:splat  301!
http://santharpanaspa.com/*   https://www.santharpanaspa.com/:splat  301!
